    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17634" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-γενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>self-produced,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμων</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.618
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				16.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.893
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				245.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτογενές, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρκισσος</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.158
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστοῦν αὐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκυνθίς</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sprung from the same stock, kindred,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				8
			</span></i> (cj. Bamberger for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτογένητον</span>).</div>
